cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this prototype pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "Machine Learning for ESG Assessment and Financial Risk: A Prototype Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Prototype research pipeline for multi-agency ESG rating divergence,
  out-of-time financial distress prediction, conformal uncertainty
  quantification, TreeSHAP stability, and a narrative-vs-performance
  discrepancy index. All panels are simulated; results are pipeline
  validation, not empirical findings.
type: software
license: MIT
